  "publishedAt": "2026-09-10T20:33:11.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"> <section aria-labelledby=\"regions-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <h2 id=\"regions-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Browse by body region</h2> </p>  </section> <section aria-labelledby=\"kinds-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <h2 id=\"kinds-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Browse by kind</h2> </p>  </section> <section aria-labelledby=\"recent-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <h2 id=\"recent-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Recently added</h2> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/changelog/\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Changelog</a> </p> <div data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <article data-oddity=\"asmr\" data-regions=\"brain skin-hair\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"community\" data-title=\"ASMR\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/asmr/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">ASMR</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A pleasant tingling that starts on the scalp and moves down the neck and spine, set off by whispering, tapping, soft sounds, or gentle personal attention. Not everyone gets it. A large online community is built around it.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Unclear; estimates 20–70%</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"benign-fasciculations\" data-regions=\"muscle nerves\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency community\" data-title=\"Benign fasciculations\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"muscle\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Muscle</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/benign-fasciculations/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Benign fasciculations</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Small visible twitches in the eyelid, calf, thumb, or arm that come and go with no weakness. About 70% of healthy people get them. They are not a sign of nerve disease.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">About 70% of healthy people</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"bppv\" data-regions=\"ears brain\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"get-it-checked\" data-title=\"BPPV\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"ears\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Ears</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/bppv/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">BPPV</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A short, intense spinning feeling set off by turning over in bed or tipping your head back. Tiny crystals in the inner ear have drifted into the wrong place. It is the most common cause of vertigo and it is very treatable.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">About 2.4% of people, lifetime</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"brain-freeze\" data-regions=\"nerves mouth-throat\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"try-it\" data-title=\"Brain freeze\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"nerves\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Nerves</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/brain-freeze/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Brain freeze</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A short, sharp headache in the forehead a few seconds after cold food or drink touches the roof of the mouth. It passes in under a minute.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">About 30–40% of people</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"brain-zaps\" data-regions=\"brain nerves\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency\" data-title=\"Brain zaps\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/brain-zaps/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Brain zaps</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A brief feeling like a small electric shock inside the head, often set off by moving the eyes. It is most common when stopping or lowering an antidepressant. It is unpleasant but not dangerous.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">15–50% of people stopping an antidepressant get withdrawal symptoms</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"call-of-the-void\" data-regions=\"brain\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency\" data-title=\"Call of the void\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/call-of-the-void/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Call of the void</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A sudden, brief thought of jumping when you stand somewhere high, or of swerving while driving, with no wish to do it. About half of people get it. It is the brain's safety system being misread, not a hidden wish.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">43–60% of people</span>  </p> </article> </div> </section> <section aria-labelledby=\"try-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <h2 id=\"try-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Try one right now</h2> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/tags/try-it/\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">See all</a> </p> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Each of these takes under a minute and needs nothing but your own body.</p> <div data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <article data-oddity=\"afterimages\" data-regions=\"eyes brain\" data-kind=\"perception\" data-tags=\"try-it illusion\" data-title=\"Afterimages\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"eyes\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Eyes</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Perception</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/afterimages/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Afterimages</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">An image that stays in your vision after the thing you looked at is gone. Bright things leave a same-colour copy for a moment. Long stares leave a copy in opposite colours.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Everyone</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"ambidexterity\" data-regions=\"brain muscle\" data-kind=\"trick\" data-tags=\"learnable genetic famous-people try-it\" data-title=\"Ambidexterity\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Trick</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/ambidexterity/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Ambidexterity</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Using both hands equally well for every task. Fewer than 1% of people are truly ambidextrous. Most people who say they are ambidextrous are mixed-handed: right hand for some jobs, left for others.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Under 1%</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"earlobe-attachment\" data-regions=\"ears skin-hair\" data-kind=\"variation\" data-tags=\"debunked-myth genetic try-it\" data-title=\"Attached and free earlobes\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"ears\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Ears</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Variation</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/earlobe-attachment/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Attached and free earlobes</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Some earlobes hang free and others join the head directly. Textbooks taught this as one gene, but a 2017 study found at least 49 genetic regions involved, and the two shapes blend into each other.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">About 61% attached in one Korean sample</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"bifid-uvula\" data-regions=\"mouth-throat\" data-kind=\"variation\" data-tags=\"try-it get-it-checked genetic\" data-title=\"Bifid uvula\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"mouth-throat\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Mouth</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Variation</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/bifid-uvula/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Bifid uvula</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">The uvula, the dangling flap at the back of the throat, is split into two lobes, in about 1 to 2% of people. On its own it is harmless, but in a baby it can be a clue to a hidden cleft of the palate.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">1–2% of people</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"blue-arcs-of-the-retina\" data-regions=\"eyes\" data-kind=\"perception\" data-tags=\"try-it\" data-title=\"Blue arcs of the retina\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"eyes\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Eyes</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Perception</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/blue-arcs-of-the-retina/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Blue arcs of the retina</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Look at a small red light in a dark room and two faint blue arcs curve away from it towards your blind spot. You are seeing the nerve fibres of your own retina light up.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">94% of healthy eyes in one clinic test</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"blue-field-entoptic-phenomenon\" data-regions=\"eyes\" data-kind=\"perception\" data-tags=\"try-it\" data-title=\"Blue field entoptic phenomenon\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"eyes\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Eyes</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Perception</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/blue-field-entoptic-phenomenon/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Blue field entoptic phenomenon</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Tiny bright dots that dart along wiggly paths when you look at a clear blue sky. They are your own white blood cells moving through the capillaries of the retina.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Everyone</span>  </p> </article> </div> </section><section aria-labelledby=\"reassure-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <h2 id=\"reassure-heading\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">It felt scary but it is normal</h2> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/tags/not-an-emergency/\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">See all</a> </p> <p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">Things that alarm people and turn out to be harmless. Each entry says when a doctor is still a good idea.</p> <div data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <article data-oddity=\"accessory-ossicles\" data-regions=\"bone-joint\" data-kind=\"variation\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency genetic\" data-title=\"Accessory ossicles\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"bone-joint\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Bones</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Variation</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/accessory-ossicles/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Accessory ossicles</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Small extra bones, most often in the foot, that form when a growth centre never fuses with its main bone. They are harmless but can be mistaken for fractures on an X-ray.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Up to 1 in 5 feet</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"alice-in-wonderland-syndrome\" data-regions=\"brain eyes\" data-kind=\"perception\" data-tags=\"childhood not-an-emergency illusion\" data-title=\"Alice in Wonderland syndrome\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Perception</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/alice-in-wonderland-syndrome/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Alice in Wonderland syndrome</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Objects, body parts, or the whole room suddenly look far too big, far too small, or far away. It mostly happens to children, often during a fever or infection, and it passes on its own. In adults it is usually linked to migraine.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">6–7% of teenagers (size distortion)</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"cervical-ribs\" data-regions=\"bone-joint nerves\" data-kind=\"variation\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency genetic\" data-title=\"Cervical rib\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"bone-joint\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Bones</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Variation</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/cervical-ribs/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Cervical rib</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">An extra rib above the normal top rib, growing from the lowest bone in the neck. About 1 in 100 people have one, and most never know.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">About 1% of people</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"charles-bonnet-syndrome\" data-regions=\"brain eyes\" data-kind=\"perception\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency illusion\" data-title=\"Charles Bonnet syndrome\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Perception</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/charles-bonnet-syndrome/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Charles Bonnet syndrome</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">People who lose a lot of their sight often start to see things that are not there: patterns, faces, small people in costume, whole landscapes. They know the images are not real. It is caused by the eyes, not the mind.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">10–40% of older people with serious sight loss</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"derealization-depersonalization\" data-regions=\"brain\" data-kind=\"involuntary\" data-tags=\"not-an-emergency community\" data-title=\"Derealization and depersonalization\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"brain\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Brain</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Involuntary</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/derealization-depersonalization/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Derealization and depersonalization</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">The world suddenly seems flat, distant, or like a film (derealization), or you feel like you are watching yourself from outside (depersonalization). Most people have a brief episode at some point, usually under stress.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">50–75% of people, at least once</span>  </p> </article><article data-oddity=\"diastasis-recti\" data-regions=\"muscle whole-body\" data-kind=\"variation\" data-tags=\"try-it not-an-emergency\" data-title=\"Diastasis recti\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> <div data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\"> </div> <p><span data-id=\"muscle\" data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"true\"><span data-astro-cid-k2qn5omv=\"\">Muscle</span> </span> <span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Variation</span> </p> <h3 data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"true\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/diastasis-recti/\" data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Diastasis recti</a> </h3> <p data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">A widening of the gap between the two halves of the six-pack muscle, seen in nearly every pregnancy and in some men. A bulge down the midline when you sit up is the usual sign.</p> <p><span data-astro-cid-2nst6b54=\"\">Almost all pregnancies; about 1 in 3 women a year after birth</span>  </p> </article> </div> </section><section data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <a href=\"https://vester.si/bodily-oddities/oddities/\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">See all 136 oddities</span> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\">\nFilter by region, kind or tag. Every entry says how common it is and lists where the number comes from.\n</span> </span>  </a> </section>  </div></div>",
